| Feature | CryptoCore | OpenSSL |
|---------|------------|---------|
| **Ease of Use** | Simple, consistent CLI | Complex, many options |
| **Default Security** | Secure defaults | May require configuration |
| **GCM Support** | Built-in, easy to use | Available but complex |
| **Key Derivation** | PBKDF2 with secure defaults | Multiple options |
