| **Performance** | Optimized for common cases | Highly optimized |
| **Interoperability** | Compatible with OpenSSL | Industry standard |
| **Documentation** | Focused, task-oriented | Comprehensive, technical |

### CryptoCore vs GPG

| Feature | CryptoCore | GPG |
|---------|------------|-----|
| **Encryption Type** | Symmetric | Asymmetric & Symmetric |
| **Key Management** | Simple keys | Complex keyrings |
| **File Format** | Simple binary | Complex armored format |
| **Integration** | Easy in scripts | More complex |
| **Authentication** | Built-in (GCM, HMAC) | Separate signing |
