## Emergency Recovery

### **Lost Key?**
```bash
# If you used auto-generated key, check your terminal history
history | grep cryptocore

# If you saved the key output, look for files containing "Generated random key"
grep -r "Generated random key" .
```

### **Corrupted File?**
```bash
# Try to extract what you can (GCM will fail completely if corrupted)
dd if=corrupted.enc of=attempt.enc bs=1M count=10  # First 10MB
cryptocore decrypt --input attempt.enc --key KEY --iv IV
```

